ognize dangers early on and act safely.\n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)", "short_description": "Experience work safety in wood construction virtually and realistically: recognize typical risks, react correctly\u2014without any risk of injury. Learn how to avoid mistakes and use tools and modules safely."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.suva.ch/de-ch/praevention/beratung-kurse-und-angebote/swiss-safety-vr/data-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Suva", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.swiss-safety-vr.ch/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["de", "it"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "39676082448645522"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1099684142433686_2767947834884043383_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZtcbDKKUFAkQ7kNvwHn23KP&_nc_oc=Ado7apQpxr5ySLtFUdyJ2Jy1CKfLFcA4B8hJjGYDzh2eRtVL2gY0th5JmO7Rht0mthA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ9qwwk0s29WJ3eEpp-324UzivkrhvR0l9DikqBi3qUKQ&oe=6AFB1E1B"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Swiss Safety VR: Timber Construction", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category